---
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro"
import FlagPK from "flag-icons/flags/4x3/pk.svg"
import FlagAE from "flag-icons/flags/4x3/ae.svg"
import FlagCA from "flag-icons/flags/4x3/ca.svg"
import { AtriosCard } from "@/components/atrios-card"

const linkClass =
  "text-link underline underline-offset-4 transition-opacity hover:opacity-70"
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-justify leading-relaxed">
    <p aria-hidden="true">📍 Toronto, Canada</p>

    <!-- 1. intro -->
    <p>
      <b>Hi, I'm Osman.</b> I'm an industrial engineer, a technologist, and a collector
      of interests. I believe AI can be used for social good all the while preserving
      our planet and upholding our humanity.
    </p>

    <!-- 2. current -->
    <p>
      Currently, I'm a founding engineer at{" "}
      <AtriosCard client:load />, a startup backed by{" "}
      <a
        href="https://speedrun.a16z.com/companies/atrios"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>a16z speedrun</a
      >. I'm also doing a master's in computer science at Georgia Tech, focusing
      on computing systems and machine learning.
    </p>

    <!-- 3. past -->
    <p>
      Previously, I was a software engineer at{" "}
      <a
        href="https://www.healthtap.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>HealthTap</a
      >, where I helped pioneer their use of AI in primary care by building a
      voice assistant designed around patient safety, privacy, and access. I
      earned my BASc in industrial engineering at UofT, where I built <a
        href="https://www.utmist.ca/projects"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>conversational recommender systems</a
      >, gave a <a
        href="https://fsaeutoronto.ca/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>self-driving FSAE car</a
      > its vision, organized <a
        href="https://yourenext.ca"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>Canada's largest student-run career fair</a
      >, ran a <a
        href="https://www.projectx2020.com/projectx-2023"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>global undergraduate ML research competition</a
      > with teams from CMU, Harvard, Cornell and ETH, and was a <a
        href="https://orientation.skule.ca/about"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>F!rosh Leedur</a
      > four years running. I also interned as an engineer at <a
        href="https://ploopy.co"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>Ploopy</a
      >, <a
        href="https://doctalk.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>Doctalk</a
      >, and <a
        href="https://molex.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>Molex</a
      >.
    </p>

    <!-- 4. personal -->
    <p>
      Before all that, I was born in Karachi <FlagPK
        role="img"
        aria-label="Pakistan"
        class="inline-block h-[0.85em] w-auto rounded-[2px] align-[-0.08em]"
      />, lived in Dubai <FlagAE
        role="img"
        aria-label="United Arab Emirates"
        class="inline-block h-[0.85em] w-auto rounded-[2px] align-[-0.08em]"
      />, and grew up in a city with the{" "}
      <a
        href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ridgeway_Plaza"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}
        >largest concentration of halal restaurants in North America</a
      >{" "}
      <FlagCA
        role="img"
        aria-label="Canada"
        class="inline-block h-[0.85em] w-auto rounded-[2px] align-[-0.08em]"
      />.
    </p>

    <p>
      Want to chat? Reach out at <b>osmansultan2002 at gmail dot com</b>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Else, find me on{" "}
      <a
        href="https://github.com/osman-sultan"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>GitHub</a
      >{" "}
      and{" "}
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/osmansultan-"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={linkClass}>LinkedIn</a
      >.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
